&lt;p data-start=&quot;2829&quot; data-end=&quot;2992&quot;&gt;If you’re passionate about &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2856&quot; data-end=&quot;2918&quot;&gt;automation, innovation, and driving operational excellence&lt;/strong&gt; in a fast-paced manufacturing environment — we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THG is proud to be a Disability Confident Committed employer. If you are invited to interview, please let us know if there are any reasonable adjustments we can make to the recruitment process that will enable you to perform to the best of your ability.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
